WEBVTT

00:00:00.601 --> 00:00:02.809
Hi there, bus counselor!

00:00:02.809 --> 00:00:08.375
Let's learn the friendliest part of your day: texting a family.

00:00:09.874 --> 00:00:15.755
Open Bus Comms on your own phone, and there's every family on your bus.

00:00:15.755 --> 00:00:16.735
In a hurry?

00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:20.492
Just start typing a camper's or parent's name.

00:00:21.997 --> 00:00:24.983
Tap a family, and their thread opens.

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:28.756
Everything you've sent them today is right here.

00:00:30.264 --> 00:00:32.251
Type your message.

00:00:32.251 --> 00:00:35.493
Keep it short, kind and clear.

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.643
Like: 'Hi!

00:00:36.643 --> 00:00:41.454
Maya's bus is running about ten minutes late.

00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:43.232
Everyone's okay!'

00:00:44.736 --> 00:00:46.027
Tap the arrow.

00:00:46.027 --> 00:00:50.760
When you see 'Sent' with a check mark, it's on its way.

00:00:52.264 --> 00:00:53.257
No signal?

00:00:53.257 --> 00:00:54.340
No worries!

00:00:54.340 --> 00:01:00.025
If a text doesn't go through, it stays right there in the box.

00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:04.447
Just tap the arrow again when you're back online.

00:01:05.954 --> 00:01:12.389
Every bus also has Quick Message, ready-made texts for the updates you send most.

00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:16.862
Look for it on your bus screen, and send it with one tap.

00:01:18.374 --> 00:01:22.671
One last thing: text families only through Bus Comms.

00:01:22.671 --> 00:01:29.117
Never tap a phone number in CampInTouch, because that calls from your own phone.

00:01:29.117 --> 00:01:32.936
Thanks for taking such good care of our campers!

